# Halt (12), Halt(1) (13), ExitProcess (14), TerminateProcess(GetCurrentProcess..) (15) in a unit
# Terminating ANOTHER process (22), Application.ProcessMessages (23), a look-alike name (24) and a string (25) must not fire
# Application.Terminate (16) is the separate rule application-terminate-in-library
halt-in-library 12
halt-in-library 13
halt-in-library 14
halt-in-library 15
!halt-in-library 16
!halt-in-library 22
!halt-in-library 23
!halt-in-library 24
!halt-in-library 25
